 "verdict": "LEGACY CARRIER SURVIVES; DISPLACED CARRIER ATTENUATED, NOT COMPOSITION-EXPLAINED: the declared-cap inbound-leg signal survives on uniform-legacy legs (p=0.00124).  The displaced-cap residual is nonsignificant on uniformly-high-Gaia legs (p=0.209) and strong on sub-threshold legs (p=8.89e-07); however the sub-threshold stratum is composition-homogeneous (only ~2% of post-2017 legs are truly stitch-mixed), in-cap members match out-of-cap on leg composition, leg contrast and perihelion epoch (T6), and the cap gap persists after regressing out absolute leg contrast.  The attenuation is therefore not explained as a catalogue-stitching systematic: it admits a composition-modulated signal amplitude or a reduction-quality dependence, while catalogue-by-sky interactions remain unresolved."
}